WEBVTT

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:09.550
Toorimase, toorimase

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:09.550
Let us pass, let us pass

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:16.070
Ikaba izuko ga hosomichi nareba

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:16.070
Where doth this narrow path lead?

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:22.770
Tenjin moto he to itaru hosomichi

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:22.770
It doth lead to the gods in Heaven

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:21.490
That morning was the same as any other.

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:25.210
Nothing stood out.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:29.240
Goiken gomuyou toorenu totemo

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:29.240
Thou thoughts matter not for ye cannot pass

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:28.660
Everything looked like usual.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:36.310
Kono ko no too no oiwai ni

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:36.310
To celebrate this child's tenth

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:33.570
1638 May the young lady, Horizon A.,
rest in peace. ~Residents of Musashi

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:36.430
I thought days like this would last forever,

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:40.830
but they shattered with the coming of that fated day.

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:43.390
Ryou no ofuda wo osame ni sanzu

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:43.390
I must make an offering with these talismans

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:49.920
Iki wa yoi nagi, kaeri wa kowaki

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:49.920
The path out is pleasant, but returning is scary

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:52.330
That's when the whole world...

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:59.950
Waga naka kowaki no tooshi kana?

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:59.950
Can I pass despite my fears?

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:24.560
Nail her!

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:26.520
Bore straight through!

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:36.240
I'm not done yet!

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:39.780
That's...

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:46.460
the bullet I fired!

00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:47.850
Judge.

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:49.460
Waste not, want not.

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:52.300
Fire straight and true!

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:10.480
Fire!

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:15.900
Tres España's heavy God of War, El Azul, eh?

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:22.260
Kazuno, don't move.

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:28.190
Bind!

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:40.930
Wh..What the...

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:43.390
I see you are confused.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:48.370
A dragonfly was cut in half upon landing on
this Shinto weapon's spearhead,

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:49.740
giving it the name:

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:52.270
Slicing Dragonfly.

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:05.430
Six minutes until it goes critical
and then that will be that.

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:07.590
You certainly took your time.

00:03:07.590 --> 00:03:08.750
Sorry 'bout that.

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.420
I'd like to go protect our lord.

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:13.990
How 'bout you?

00:03:14.550 --> 00:03:17.130
I shall do as Lord Motonobu wishes.

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:19.240
Gotcha.

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:27.200
Graduates Under the Moon

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:29.140
If possible, I would have liked a change of clothes.

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.020
Kazuno?

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.000
Hey!

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:49.390
Kazuno!

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:50.200
We have company!

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:14.310
This is the first we've crossed paths.

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:17.950
I am a Tres España ally and have earned the title

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:22.430
God-Speed García de Ceballos,
Muneshige Tachibana.

00:04:22.730 --> 00:04:25.030
I fall under the strike force class.

00:04:25.650 --> 00:04:30.740
With my Lype Katarripsi,
an Armor of Deadly Sins,

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:34.120
I am also referred to as one of the
Eight Great Dragon Kings.

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:36.920
Ain't you ready and rearing to fight!

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:38.540
Testament!

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:43.280
I urge you to surrender.

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:44.970
Bind, Slicing Dragonfly!

00:04:57.410 --> 00:04:59.940
I see you aren't called "God-Speed" for nothing.

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:01.200
Tes.

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:03.740
Slicing Dragonfly acquires and
severs an object's name

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:06.410
when reflected on the spearhead.

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:09.170
It has a 30-meter range.

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:11.190
So, I must either avoid letting it catch my reflection

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:13.630
or stay outside its range.

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:16.130
Who told you that?

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:18.790
What, you're still alive?

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:22.850
My, I didn't realize you like embracing corpses.

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:24.980
I was using ya as armor.

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:28.180
Then you should hold me like this.

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:32.500
I let the blast of energy enter my left hand

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:36.480
and used my ability to manipulate gravity to redirect it.

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:38.870
What was that?

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:41.770
Lype Katarripsi's super-drive.

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:47.450
Lype Katarripsi has three different functions.

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:50.310
It functions as a normal gunblade.

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:54.060
It has a normal drive function akin
to my Slicing Dragonfly's.

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:57.410
And as an Armor of Deadly Sins, it has a super-drive.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:03.340
It shaves away the existence of anything its
blade reflects within a certain range.

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:08.380
Indeed, once activated, it begins tearing
through things as a sign of regret.

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:14.600
It has a 3km range, eh?

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:18.600
And I'd say you can only activate
that function one more time.

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:19.990
Tes.

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:24.230
The northwestern and southeastern reactors
are currently within my range.

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:27.430
If I use my final shot to destroy one of them,

00:06:27.430 --> 00:06:30.540
the remaining three reactors will have
a place to divert the pressure,

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:32.130
so they won't explode.

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:34.540
It will save Mikawa.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:39.460
But see, that isn't what the lord of Mikawa wants.

00:06:56.570 --> 00:06:58.430
The Platonic Plate Reactor...

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:08.930
The distillation plants have already hit critical
and are amassing ether.

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:12.990
When that tower of light topples,

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:16.810
the liquid ether will cause an overload.

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:18.300
<i>Exactly!</i>

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:21.310
<i>I'm impressed we've made it this far.</i>

00:07:21.310 --> 00:07:23.460
<i>You've got about five minutes to stop us if you can.</i>

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:26.990
<i>What will it be, Muneshige Tachibana?</i>

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:30.290
<i>You must use your time wisely.</i>

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:30.700
Motonobu
Matsudaira

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:34.010
<i>Now then, everyone across the land!</i>

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:35.970
Good evening!

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:41.890
Today, I'm in Mikawa,
where the reactors are going wild!

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:43.730
Lord Motonobu...

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:48.090
The World

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:46.220
Yes, Muneshige Tachibana?

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:48.110
Got something to say?

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:49.570
Tes!

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:51.220
I wish to ask a question!

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.700
Why on earth are you trying to obliterate Mikawa

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:56.260
and endanger the Far East?

00:07:57.090 --> 00:07:59.080
Good question!

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:02.060
So, let me ask you something.

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:05.330
Aren't tight spots a blast?

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:10.930
And you know how I'm always saying thinking is fun?

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:15.390
So, wouldn't something so dangerous
you gotta think super-duper hard

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:20.430
or you'll get wiped out make for the ultimate thrill?

00:08:20.970 --> 00:08:23.440
But there's something better than that!

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:27.450
It takes way more thought!

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:29.860
What might that be, Muneshige?

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:31.440
I wouldn't know!

00:08:31.930 --> 00:08:34.290
I see, so you don't know?

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:35.660
In that case,

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:39.870
you shall die without ever facing your fears.

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:43.640
Use your head if that bugs you.

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:45.920
That's what it takes to overcome your fears.

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:48.180
Honda, do you know the answer?

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:51.550
Nope, I'm clueless!

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:52.640
Got it.

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:55.930
As punishment, stand there with
an automated doll hanging from your neck.

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:58.390
That's not fair!

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:02.470
Well, folks, the answer's obvious.

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:06.340
There's only one thing more scary
than endangering the Far East.

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:07.650
Yep!

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:10.650
It's Armageddon!

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:10.630
Divine Transmission

00:09:10.970 --> 00:09:14.500
The end of our world makes for
the ultimate entertainment.

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:19.660
Right now, you are about to graduate
into an apocalyptic world with no future.

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:21.570
Thrilling, isn't it?

00:09:21.570 --> 00:09:23.570
If you wish to avoid the apocalypse,

00:09:23.570 --> 00:09:26.350
think with all your might to prevent it

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:29.170
and then look to the future.

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:32.670
Use what precious little time you have left to think.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:36.590
I shall reward anyone who comes up
with a good answer.

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:40.180
It may be able to prevent the end of the world.

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:41.390
And it's...

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:43.850
The Armor of Deadly Sins.

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:47.520
Bluntly put,

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:51.770
whoever possesses the Armor of Deadly Sins
can sway the apocalypse.

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:55.570
But weren't you the one who gave
them to various countries?

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.490
Isn't telling us to gather them up

00:09:57.800 --> 00:10:01.200
like instructing us to war over the eight pieces?

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:02.620
Eight?

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:04.910
You're incorrect; there are nine.

00:10:05.260 --> 00:10:06.620
You sneaky bastard!

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.420
About the model for the eight Armors...

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:12.340
Evagrios claimed there are eight temptations,

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:15.660
but he also spoke of a ninth evil.

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:19.700
The ninth temptation, which is excluded
from those eight, is "jealousy."

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:23.600
All sin is born from jealousy.

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:26.560
Then, where is that "jealousy"?

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:29.080
Have you ever heard the rumor

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:32.300
that these weapons were made from humans?

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:34.530
That's the honest truth.

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:40.070
The Armors of Deadly Sins are made
from a certain girl's emotions.

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:45.710
A decade ago, I ran over her and
turned her into the Armors of Deadly Sins.

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:52.140
Last year, I planted the ninth Armor,
"Jealousy," into her soul,

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:55.770
gave her an automated doll's body
and sent her to Musashi.

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:57.530
It can't be!

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:00.640
She's Horizon Ariadust,

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:03.450
or the automated doll P-01s.

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:07.910
Her very soul is

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:10.790
the Jealousy Armor of Deadly Sins, Oros Phthonos.

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:13.060
Foolish brother!

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:19.280
Go after him...

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:23.740
The Testament Union says,

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:27.340
"Find and apprehend the Armor of Deadly Sins."

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:33.460
Why?! Why'd he do that to
an automated doll with a soul?

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:35.670
I saw Horizon today.

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:38.260
She was waving at me.

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:48.970
Has anything changed within the past decade?

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:51.120
The rest is up to you.

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:53.790
A world war could occur.

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:55.610
And the Far East may fall under totalitarian rule.

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:57.730
But wouldn't it be great

00:11:58.370 --> 00:12:02.250
to see a world war not mentioned in the Testament?

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:04.990
I'll just have to stop you!

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:07.150
Good answer!

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:11.070
But that could prove unfortunate,

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:14.580
so Vice-Prez, do something about him.

00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:19.300
Tadakatsu Honda!

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:24.340
We've still got three minutes!

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:28.180
I'll stop the troublemaker.

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:46.660
Can you accelerate faster?

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.280
You bet I can!

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:53.370
Bind, Lype Katarripsi!

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:02.880
You reflected Lype Katarripsi on
Slicing Dragonfly to nullify its attack?

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:05.390
The power gap between us is blaring,

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:06.720
in which case...

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:11.770
You're standing on Slicing Dragonfly?

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:14.490
Nice move, but...

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:20.650
That old trick won't work in this day and age!

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:25.750
Bind, Slicing Dragonfly!

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:34.580
He's walking on air?!

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:36.320
I must defeat him.

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:40.040
Even if it means accelerating until
my body gives out on me!

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:42.840
Boost acceleration by 17,000x!

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:54.270
Accelerate my left leg!

00:13:56.630 --> 00:13:59.270
Bind and sever, Slicing Dragonfly!

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:03.650
What?!

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:11.940
That was the advanced drive for
Slicing Dragonfly, which can sever anything.

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:14.370
I severed the area north of me.

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:17.160
That's nuts!

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:19.120
Slicing Dragonfly!

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:25.880
Enclose him.

00:14:37.010 --> 00:14:38.330
Bind!

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:48.800
I must apologize for my impudence.

00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:51.700
It's my armor's special ability, so no worries.

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:55.160
He's been taking full advantage of
his superior weapon anyway.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.210
Judge.

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:58.160
Life is hard for those less gifted.

00:14:58.970 --> 00:15:00.760
Why you little...

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:09.530
Lype Katarripsi's super-drive virtual turret?

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:12.510
You botched it up?

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:14.250
Shut up!

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:25.520
He stabbed it into himself.

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:30.490
He hid the spearhead within his body to
keep it from reflecting his image.

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:41.540
He's out cold.

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:46.800
Master Tadakatsu...

00:15:47.240 --> 00:15:48.170
Yeah?

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:50.430
Lype Katarripsi has been activated.

00:15:50.430 --> 00:15:52.480
It's merely accumulating energy.

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:54.530
Judge.

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:56.150
It's aimed at the plant.

00:15:56.150 --> 00:15:59.100
Can you sever a direction like before?

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:02.140
I'm afraid I can't activate any more advanced drives.

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:07.510
My gravity manipulation ability is incomplete,
so I cannot use it as I did earlier.

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:10.860
Therefore, I believe you know what we must do.

00:16:18.730 --> 00:16:22.020
I turned my wife's ring into a soul

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:25.970
and you just had to inherit her foul mouth.

00:16:35.480 --> 00:16:40.390
This automated doll is functioning off reserves
in power conservation mode.

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:43.850
Please make any final requests promptly.

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:49.290
Then, I'd like you to obey Kazuno's final order.

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:51.360
Judge.

00:16:54.610 --> 00:16:55.780
Here it comes.

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:03.960
Slicing Dragonfly!

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:12.130
Master Tadakatsu...

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:18.500
Bind!

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:38.780
It missed!

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:46.290
You severed the Armor of Deadly Sins'
attack with Slicing Dragonfly?

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:49.210
What amazing skill.

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:53.870
It wasn't all that tough.

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:56.680
All I did was have it hit Kazuno
before severing her existence.

00:17:57.380 --> 00:17:59.390
This area's gonna be sky-high soon.

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:01.330
Take him and go.

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:03.620
Or do you wanna go a round?

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:05.310
Surely you jest, I...

00:18:05.510 --> 00:18:09.700
Aren't you Gin Tachibana,
Dousetsu Tachibana's oldest daughter?

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:11.860
I hear you're strong!

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:17.030
My father bequeathed the Tachibana name
unto Master Muneshige.

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:18.560
That says it all.

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:22.660
That doesn't mean you're a pushover.

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:27.330
I am forbidden to fight.

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:30.020
I shall take my leave now.

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:32.380
Judge.

00:18:33.620 --> 00:18:36.170
You're cool with me stealing victory?

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:38.420
There are rules of succession.

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:43.100
I believe Master Muneshige will get
a rematch with Tadakatsu II.

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:45.690
Talk about a sore loser!

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:50.230
Isn't this...

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:53.720
Give that to my heir if you want a rematch.

00:18:53.720 --> 00:18:56.690
That way she can have a fair match with that kid.

00:18:57.770 --> 00:18:58.650
Tes.

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:11.690
Now then...

00:19:38.230 --> 00:19:40.720
Aren't you cold, Masazumi?

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:41.700
It doesn't matter!

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:47.870
Masazumi...

00:19:49.240 --> 00:19:53.580
I am not P-01s, am I?

00:20:12.260 --> 00:20:14.360
Ether oscillation patterns match up.

00:20:14.620 --> 00:20:17.150
That is undeniably an Armor of Deadly Sins.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.250
Apprehend her.

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:33.500
Horizon!

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:47.030
Activating Spell: "March" Universal

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:52.430
Those punches were pathetic!

00:20:57.160 --> 00:21:01.120
This area is hereby under K.P.A. Italia's jurisdiction

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:03.300
by the Testament Union's decree.

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:05.490
Horizon!

00:21:10.550 --> 00:21:12.940
Such actions are meaningless.

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:20.480
I, P-01s...

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:22.570
Horizon...

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:27.140
cannot save myself from this situation.

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:37.000
List of Instructor's Comments

00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:36.550
Shouldn't I follow the advice found in this?

00:21:37.390 --> 00:21:38.980
Horizon!

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:40.690
Listen to me, Horizon!

00:21:44.580 --> 00:21:47.280
No, this is bad.

00:21:48.930 --> 00:21:50.530
I have to...

00:21:50.810 --> 00:21:52.410
He can't keep talking!

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:54.200
Shut up, moron!

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:03.300
You can't save anyone like that.

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:11.440
You can't reach her.

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:18.270
Class is hereby in session!

00:22:40.450 --> 00:22:43.090
Aren't you a bit early?

00:22:45.800 --> 00:22:54.190
I embrace my battered courage as I step forward

00:22:45.800 --> 00:22:54.190
Kizu darake no yuuki wo daite aruki dasu yo

00:22:54.600 --> 00:23:02.650
I have decided to forge tomorrow with my own hands

00:22:54.600 --> 00:23:02.650
Kono te de asu wo tsukuri dasu to kimeta kara

00:23:03.740 --> 00:23:08.150
Oh, stars, shine upon

00:23:03.740 --> 00:23:08.150
Saa, hoshi yo, terashite

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:12.730
The melody that was just born here

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:12.730
Koko ni ima umareta melody

00:23:10.390 --> 00:23:13.750
We'll never be parted again.

00:23:12.730 --> 00:23:17.470
Sono egao wo tonari de

00:23:12.730 --> 00:23:17.470
I would like to see that

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:19.310
1648, Testament Era April 20th  9:03 P.M.

00:23:17.470 --> 00:23:21.480
Mite itai to omoun da

00:23:17.470 --> 00:23:21.480
Smile of yours up close

00:23:21.870 --> 00:23:31.010
Itami ni tsuranukarete, kimi no na wo sakenda

00:23:21.870 --> 00:23:31.010
Piercing with pain, I screamed out your name

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:40.770
Someday I wish to tell you something on the horizon

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:41.270
Mada tooi kyoukai no ue de itsuka tsutaetai

00:23:39.510 --> 00:23:43.480
Itoshisa no fiore…

00:23:39.510 --> 00:23:43.480
My precious fiore…

00:23:40.220 --> 00:23:46.460
On April 21, 1648, Testament Era, at 6:00 A.M.,

00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:49.060
automated doll P-01s

00:23:49.060 --> 00:23:53.400
was officially acknowledged as Mikawa's ruler,
Horizon Ariadust.

00:23:53.720 --> 00:23:58.200
At the same time, she was charged with
the loss of Mikawa as its leader

00:23:58.200 --> 00:24:00.300
and sentenced to suicide.

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:04.560
It was to be carried out that day at 6:00 P.M.

